d nutrition. It is also the workplace of Estefanía Santos Mazo, who practices at this hospital.", "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO MIGUEL SERVET:Hospital Universitario Miguel Servet is a clinical institution located in Zaragoza, Spain, specializing in clinical nutrition and dietetics. The hospital is particularly focused on providing care for diabetic patients. Dr. Alejandro Sanz París serves as the head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at this facility, overseeing its operations and ensuring the delivery of specialized nutritional care.", "HOSPITAL GENERAL UNIVERSITARIO JOSÉ M. MORALES MESEGUER:Hospital General Universitario José M. Morales Meseguer is a hospital in Murcia specializing in endocrinology and nutrition.", "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO DE ARABA:Hospital Universitario de Araba (HUA) is a hospital located in Vitoria-Gasteiz specializing in endocrinology and nutrition.", "COMPLEJO HOSPITALARIO DE TORRECÁRDENAS:Complejo Hospitalario de Torrecárdenas is a hospital in Almería specializing in endocrinology and nutrition.", "HOSPITAL ROYO VILLANOVA:Hospital Royo Villanova is a medical facility located in Zaragoza, Spain. It specializes in various health services, with a particular focus on endocrinology and nutrition. The hospital is recognized for its expertise in these areas, providing comprehensive care to patients in need of specialized medical attention.", "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO CENTRAL DE ASTURIAS:The Hospital Universitario Central de Asturias is a prominent medical facility located in Oviedo, Spain. It specializes in endocrinology and nutrition, providing comprehensive healthcare services in these fields. Among its esteemed staff is Dr. Francisco Villazón González, who serves as a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition, contributing to the hospital's reputation for excellence in patient care and medical expertise.", "DR. CARLOS SÁNCHEZ JUAN:Dr. Carlos Sánchez Juan is a medical doctor who serves as the head of the Endocrinology and Nutrition department at Hospital General Universitario de Valencia. He holds the position of director científico and is responsible for overseeing the Endocrinology and Nutrition Service at the same hospital. His leadership role encompasses both clinical and scientific aspects of the department, highlighting his expertise and commitment to the field of endocrinology and nutrition.", "DRA. ANA ISABEL SÁNCHEZ MARCOS:Dra. Ana Isabel Sánchez Marcos is a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition at Complejo Asistencial Universitario de Salamanca.", "DRA. ESTEFANÍA SANTOS MAZO:Dra. Estefanía Santos Mazo is a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital Universitario de Burgos.", "DR. ALEJANDRO SANZ PARÍS:Dr. Alejandro Sanz París is the Director Técnico and head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at Hospital Universitario Miguel Servet in Zaragoza. He oversees the clinical nutrition and dietetics section, where he is responsible for managing and directing the unit's activities and ensuring the delivery of high-quality nutritional care.", "DRA. YAMINA SULEIMAN MARTOS:Dra. Yamina Suleiman Martos is a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital General Universitario José M. Morales Meseguer in Murcia. She is also an author of a clinical case that addresses the relationship between diabetes and malabsorption, showcasing her expertise in the field of endocrinology and her contributions to medical literature.", "DRA. SARA VALLE RODRÍGUEZ-NAVAS:Dra. Sara Valle Rodríguez-Navas is a medical professional specializing in endocrinology and nutrition, currently practicing at Hospital Universitario de Araba in Vitoria-Gasteiz. She focuses on nutritional management for patients with type 1 diabetes and also provides care for individuals with rumination syndrome. Her expertise lies in managing the nutritional needs of these patients, ensuring they receive appropriate dietary guidance to support their health conditions."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperat